  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>遇到問題或擔心模組不相容？請查看 <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</strong></p>\n<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8Se8aWc_JNg\">\n</iframe></span></span>\n<h4>免責聲明：本預告片並非數據包功能的真實還原（非一比一呈現）</h4>\n<h1>👨‍🌾 人形村民</h1>\n<p><em>這是一款數據包，將那些無聊的村民替換為玩家！名稱、貼圖與對話皆為隨機生成，且由於完全基於資料驅動，可輕鬆進行擴充。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"fapi-badge\"></a></p>\n<p><em>^ 僅在運行於 Fabric 或 Quilt 時需要</em></p>\n<h2>🔗 連結</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EclipseStudiosMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4pYjW9btNc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252feclipse-studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"github-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EclipseStudios447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"patreon-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/elgeroingles/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252felgeroingles%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/ElGeroIngles/860767aa976892908afff9f2c4b9648f/raw/eda5e7344a38837c32e34a1c0f8a4de180d38d5c/planet_minecraft_cozy.svg\" alt=\"planet_minecraft\"></a></p>\n<h2>❤️ 特別感謝…</h2>\n<h4>🔧 協助與工具…</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@thepieslayer</code> 與 <code>@tyllrrrr</code> 來自我的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/4pYjW9btNc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>，感謝他們提供對話建議。</li>\n<li><code>@aksiome</code> 與 <code>@ethanout</code> 協助開發射線投射系統。</li>\n<li><code>@merak48763</code> 協助處理人體模型（Mannequins）相關功能。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h4>🌐 支援語言（貢獻者）…</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>英文 (en_us)：由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 翻譯。</li>\n<li>西班牙文 (es_es)：由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fElGeroIngles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ElGeroIngles</a> 翻譯。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>您可以透過翻譯成其他語言來為此專案貢獻！請見<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>了解詳情。</p>\n<h2>🛠️ 擴充套件 (Addons)</h2>\n<p>想學習如何製作新增名稱、貼圖與對話的<strong>擴充套件</strong>嗎？請前往<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>查看教學！</p>\n<h2>📝 實用資訊</h2>\n<p>需要關於此專案的任何資訊嗎？請查看其<a href=\"https://github.com/Eclipse-Studios/humanoid_villagers/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>！</p>",
